<text>
<p>Second quarter 1997</p>
<p>Operating profit by business segment (millions of guilders)</p>
<p>    Chemicals					172  vs  140</p>
<p>    Coatings					 269  vs  193</p>
<p>    Pharmaceuticals				233  vs  200</p>
<p>    Fibres					    20  vs   15</p>
